# Local-only rules for the research tooling. The root .gitignore already
# ignores *.har / *.cookie / *.token; this file adds the local session
# artifacts produced by tools/kingo-live/ and keeps the synthetic HAR fixture
# trackable (a deeper .gitignore overrides the parent *.har pattern).
!kingo-live/capture.example.har

config.json
config.local.json
config.merged.json
schema-draft.json
har-report.json
records.jsonl
probe-body.txt
*.sqlite
